{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T15:51:09.005Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "ggplot2 功能展示",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "r",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 13,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# ggplot2 功能展示\n\n使用 SciREPL 暗色主题的交互式 ggplot2 图表 — 自动应用，无需额外配置。\n\n使用 R 内置数据集（`mpg`, `mtcars`）。无需下载数据。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "install.packages(\"ggplot2\")\nlibrary(ggplot2)\ncat(\"已加载 ggplot2 — theme_scirepl() 已自动应用\\n\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "已加载 ggplot2 — theme_scirepl() 已自动应用",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">已加载 ggplot2 — theme_scirepl() 已自动应用</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "## 1. 带趋势线的散点图",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(displ, hwy, color = class)) +\n  geom_point(size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +\n  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = FALSE, color = \"#58a6ff\") +\n  labs(title = \"发动机排量 vs 高速燃油经济性 (MPG)\",\n       x = \"排量 (L)\", y = \"高速燃油经济性 (MPG)\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'</pre><img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/14706b17-d32d-48cd-ae53-d54e399e1abf\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "## 2. 分面柱状图",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_bar(position = \"dodge\") +\n  facet_wrap(~year) +\n  labs(title = \"按驱动类型划分的车型类别 (1999 vs 2008)\",\n       x = \"车型类别\", y = \"数量\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/8f5c692d-a29f-4a6b-a158-2874b134b351\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "## 3. 密度图",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(hwy, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_density(alpha = 0.5) +\n  labs(title = \"按驱动类型划分的高速燃油经济性 (MPG) 分布\",\n       x = \"高速燃油经济性 (MPG)\", y = \"密度\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/a6d7b856-ecb9-41c0-bb60-a0696af21bfe\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "## 4. 带抖动散点的箱线图 (Boxplot with Jitter)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, hwy, fill = class)) +\n  geom_boxplot(alpha = 0.7, show.legend = FALSE) +\n  geom_jitter(width = 0.2, alpha = 0.3, size = 1) +\n  labs(title = \"按车型类别划分的高速燃油经济性 (MPG)\",\n       x = \"车型类别\", y = \"高速燃油经济性 (MPG)\") +\n  coord_flip()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/a68fee3f-3021-44ef-8d5f-b0e3b13d9835\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "## 5. 相关性热力图",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "corr <- round(cor(mtcars), 2)\nvars <- colnames(mtcars)\ngrid <- expand.grid(x = vars, y = vars)\ngrid$value <- as.vector(corr)\nggplot(grid, aes(x, y, fill = value)) +\n  geom_tile(color = \"#30363d\") +\n  geom_text(aes(label = ifelse(abs(value) > 0.5, value, \"\")),\n            color = \"#e6edf3\", size = 2.5) +\n  scale_fill_gradient2(low = \"#f85149\", mid = \"#161b22\", high = \"#58a6ff\",\n                       midpoint = 0, limits = c(-1, 1)) +\n  labs(title = \"mtcars 相关性热力图\", fill = \"r\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/d7446882-d997-42e7-9ea7-61f8f053d02b\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "## 总结\n\n上述所有图表均使用 `theme_scirepl()`，该主题在 SciREPL 中加载 ggplot2 时自动应用。\n\n使用标准的 ggplot2 `+ theme(...)` 覆盖项即可自定义任何图表。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}